/**
@page boards Supported boards
@tableofcontents

HomeCore builds for three boards. Each one selects an architecture, SoC, and
board port at configure time through `HOMECORE_BOARD`; the portable kernel,
shell, VFS, and G2BASIC code is the same on all of them. Only QEMU runs are
validated. No board has been validated on physical hardware yet.

